<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Friday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>No sales confirmed following weekly movement of 41,200</p>
<p>head. Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the</p>
<p>feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None   Week Ago - 100   Year Ago - 2,200</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
